title: NPC_Dialogue
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title:loadPhase
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>
<<setPhase NPC>>
//the NPC gameObject name called in the <<setPhase>> command should map to the SPECIFIC NPC you want to reference
//FOR INSTANCE: if you have a particular gameObject NPC that you want this to call from, make sure you're using that gameObject name
<<if $dialogPhase == "Begin">>
<<jump Start>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Nicholas: Hello there, stranger!
Nicholas: Nice to see you.
Nicholas: I have a lil' pickle that I need you to solve.
Nicholas: Can you help me?
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Yes I can.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Nicholas: Great news! Thanks a bunch!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    ->Not right now, old man.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        Nicholas: Well... that hurts my feelings.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
